{
  "title": "Jeweled Tunisian Bean Sprouts Stir Fry",
  "description": "A pungent and flavorful Tunisian dish featuring bean sprouts, perfect for a Buddhist temple gathering, with a glassy jelly like texture from the added pomegranate molasses.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
